    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπρ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rough</i>, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίγλη</span>, named from its habitat
				(<i>rough</i> rocks), <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of leprous character</i>, of a disease, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.35
			</span></i>; of a man, <i>suffering from a leprous disease</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.315
			</span></i>.</div>
